OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_B1F_Text_DuncanIntro::
	.string "You came down the whole ship for\n"
	.string "this? There's nothing here.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_B1F_Text_DuncanDefeat::
	.string "Nothing but us.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_B1F_Text_DuncanPostBattle::
	.string "The hold flooded first. We never\n"
	.string "found out what holed her.\p"
	.string "Whatever it was went under and\n"
	.string "didn't come back up.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_B1F_Text_Bilge::
	.string "The hold's under this. Was,\n"
	.string "anyway. It's all water now.\p"
	.string "Something's down there that\n"
	.string "doesn't need to breathe. I'd\l"
	.string "know -- neither do I.$"
